Use this template to create an anchor to the text, e.g. [[#this line]] will link to this line. {{anchor|this line}}

<pre>
Use this template to create an anchor to the text, e.g. [[#this line]] will link to this line. {{anchor|this line}}
</pre>

Always write the template name in lower case. code taken from [[mh:dev:Template:Anchor]].

Example:
<pre>
*{{anchor|item 1}} '''Item 1''': item 1 is this
</pre>

yields:
*{{anchor|item 1}} '''Item 1''': item 1 is this

and now you can link to [[Template:Anchor#item 1]] and get that item